WEBVTT

00:01.084 --> 00:02.919
[siren blaring]

00:15.056 --> 00:16.433
[swallows]

00:17.809 --> 00:19.853
[breathing deeply]

00:21.354 --> 00:22.897
[groans]

00:23.481 --> 00:24.566
[officer 1] Your friend?

00:25.066 --> 00:27.235
Can you explain
what you mentioned earlier?

00:27.736 --> 00:30.780
Well, there's a kid
whose name is Oh Beom-seok.

00:30.864 --> 00:32.824
He goes to Byuksan High School,
over there.

00:32.907 --> 00:36.953
- [officer 1] Oh Beom-seok?
- [Yeong-i] Yes. He called me to a café.

00:37.037 --> 00:39.164
- But he wasn't there by himself.
- Yeong-a.

00:41.207 --> 00:42.751
[gasps] Are you okay?

00:45.837 --> 00:48.548
Are you all right?
Where'd the other students go?

00:50.884 --> 00:52.427
I was the only one there.

00:53.762 --> 00:56.598
- [gasps]
- Listen, it's all right, okay?

00:56.681 --> 00:59.642
You can be honest with us.
You can trust us.

01:01.478 --> 01:03.354
[sighs] I was there alone.

01:04.105 --> 01:05.356
Stop lying.

01:07.233 --> 01:08.193
Don't tell

01:10.028 --> 01:11.905
Su-ho about what happened today.

01:11.988 --> 01:13.156
[Yeong-i gasps] What?

01:16.618 --> 01:17.994
[Su-ho] Hey, Yeon Si-eun.

01:21.581 --> 01:22.791
Hey, Si-eun-a.

01:25.085 --> 01:26.377
[sighs]

01:44.187 --> 01:45.730
[tapping]

01:48.191 --> 01:49.692
[phone buzzing]

01:55.865 --> 01:57.367
[buzzing continues]

02:08.044 --> 02:09.254
[Si-eun] Beom-seok-a.

02:09.921 --> 02:11.756
[poignant music playing]

02:14.008 --> 02:15.135
Yeah?

02:15.218 --> 02:16.928
It's time to stop.

02:19.597 --> 02:21.307
Stop messing with Su-ho.

02:26.980 --> 02:28.481
[breathing shakily]

02:31.025 --> 02:32.026
[phone bleeps]

02:35.655 --> 02:37.657
[siren blaring]

02:40.994 --> 02:41.995
[sighs]

02:47.709 --> 02:49.210
[music fades]

02:50.545 --> 02:52.547
["Hero" by Meego playing]

03:05.852 --> 03:10.982
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

04:03.993 --> 04:08.706
DIVIDING NUMBERS WITH TWO AND THREE DIGITS

04:08.790 --> 04:11.042
[Si-eun's father] Honey,
I just asked what you were doing

04:11.125 --> 04:12.543
while he was out getting hurt.

04:12.627 --> 04:13.962
What's wrong with that?

04:14.045 --> 04:16.005
[mother] You're not the only busy one.

04:16.089 --> 04:19.759
Do you think I just relax at home
while you're out training and competing?

04:20.593 --> 04:22.595
You said you wanted to work together.

04:22.679 --> 04:24.597
You said you'd help raise our kid well.

04:24.681 --> 04:26.683
It was your idea to have a kid
in the first place.

04:26.766 --> 04:28.351
I thought it would be easy!

04:30.561 --> 04:31.646
He always gets hurt.

04:31.729 --> 04:34.065
- I thought that he would be a normal kid.
- [mother scoffs]

04:34.816 --> 04:35.942
[sighs]

04:37.902 --> 04:39.028
[sighs]

04:41.447 --> 04:43.491
Uh, uh… Si… Si… Si-eun-a.

04:44.075 --> 04:45.034
Si-eun-a.

04:45.118 --> 04:47.120
[poignant music playing]

04:48.162 --> 04:49.163
Si-eun-a.

04:49.831 --> 04:52.000
Open the door, Si-eun-a. Talk to me.

04:52.500 --> 04:55.336
[mother] Si-eun-a,
will you open the door? Hmm?

04:56.796 --> 04:58.214
- [father] Si-eun-a.
- [knocking]

04:58.298 --> 05:00.800
Open the door, Si-eun-a.
Talk to me, please?

05:00.883 --> 05:01.968
[mother sighs]

05:02.051 --> 05:03.803
- [knocking]
- [father] Yeon Si-eun.

05:04.804 --> 05:07.682
Mom and Dad weren't fighting.
We were just talking.

05:07.765 --> 05:09.726
- Si-eun-a.
- [knocking]

05:10.685 --> 05:12.312
[father] Si-eun-a. Yeon Si-eun.

05:12.979 --> 05:14.022
[mother] Si-eun-a.

05:16.899 --> 05:17.942
[father] Si-eun-a.

05:20.945 --> 05:22.947
[poignant music continues]

05:27.994 --> 05:30.830
[father] It's all right.
Tell me the truth.

05:30.913 --> 05:32.248
[music fades]

05:32.332 --> 05:34.792
Was it the same jerks
who punched your face last time?

05:34.876 --> 05:35.918
[Si-eun sighs]

05:36.627 --> 05:39.464
I'm telling the truth.
I fell down the stairs.

05:40.548 --> 05:42.508
I don't believe that's what happened.

05:43.509 --> 05:44.635
Why were you there?

05:46.888 --> 05:47.930
No reason.

05:49.182 --> 05:50.308
[sighs]

05:51.559 --> 05:53.394
I'm going to transfer you
to another school.

05:54.437 --> 05:55.688
That's all there is to it.

05:55.772 --> 05:57.940
- I don't want to.
- You don't what?

05:59.150 --> 06:00.651
Why are you being like that?

06:01.444 --> 06:03.529
I mean,
it's hard enough raising you by myself.

06:03.613 --> 06:05.281
- Why won't you listen?
- Hey, Dad.

06:09.243 --> 06:10.703
I've been kinda wondering.

06:12.372 --> 06:15.083
How come you're so interested
in my life all of a sudden?

06:16.751 --> 06:17.627
What?

06:25.343 --> 06:26.594
[sighs] Nothing.

06:27.762 --> 06:28.846
[door opens]

06:32.266 --> 06:33.351
[door closes]

06:33.434 --> 06:35.186
[alarm bleeping]

07:06.509 --> 07:08.511
[camera shutters clicking]

07:09.679 --> 07:10.847
[Jin-won laughs]

07:14.809 --> 07:15.810
[phone buzzes]

07:16.811 --> 07:17.645
Yes?

07:19.939 --> 07:21.357
Beom-seok-kun is here at home.

07:21.441 --> 07:22.567
How did it go?

07:22.650 --> 07:24.277
The Seocho Police Station will keep quiet.

07:24.360 --> 07:27.155
And for his school,
I've already spoken to the principal.

07:28.531 --> 07:30.032
The madam went to Jeju Island,

07:30.116 --> 07:32.326
so keep an eye on him
and stay by his side.

07:32.410 --> 07:34.328
Who knows what Beom-seok will do next?

07:37.165 --> 07:39.709
He's being sent abroad.
Find him a school in the Philippines.

07:40.293 --> 07:41.127
All right.

07:41.627 --> 07:42.462
[phone bleeps]

07:44.797 --> 07:46.007
[Beom-seok] How did you know?

07:50.094 --> 07:53.431
Aide Park-nim told me
that I would find you in there.

07:55.224 --> 07:56.684
[Beom-seok] About yesterday.

08:00.438 --> 08:01.898
I got a call from the police.

08:03.357 --> 08:04.400
Yeon Si-eun,

08:05.276 --> 08:06.986
he wanted to let this incident go.

08:07.570 --> 08:09.197
He said that he was your friend.

08:13.618 --> 08:16.120
[teacher] What's important
is what they demanded.

08:16.621 --> 08:17.497
In this revolt…

08:18.873 --> 08:20.166
Someone wake him up.

08:21.000 --> 08:23.127
- Everyone, stay awake.
- [boy 1] Hey, Su-ho.

08:23.836 --> 08:24.670
Ahn Su-ho.

08:25.630 --> 08:27.215
[teacher] Where did we leave off?

08:29.300 --> 08:31.093
Why is no one answering me?

08:31.177 --> 08:32.428
[Su-ho sighs]

08:32.512 --> 08:34.472
[teacher] The class president should know.

08:34.555 --> 08:36.933
[boy 2] The Japan-Korea Treaty of 1876.

08:37.016 --> 08:39.018
[teacher] All right, then. In that case,

08:40.394 --> 08:42.396
turn to page 109.

08:42.480 --> 08:44.815
Let's learn about the Donghak Uprising.

08:44.899 --> 08:46.567
[tense music playing]

08:46.651 --> 08:48.069
Shall we begin?

08:48.152 --> 08:50.029
To understand the Donghak Uprising,

08:50.112 --> 08:52.698
first we have to learn
about the peasant forces…

08:52.782 --> 08:54.450
[phone buzzing]

08:57.036 --> 08:59.163
AHN SU-HO

09:05.044 --> 09:08.798
SOMETHING CAME UP AT HOME
SO I CAN'T COME TO SCHOOL FOR A WHILE

09:13.302 --> 09:15.096
[Su-ho] Where were you last night? Huh?

09:15.596 --> 09:16.889
You ignored all my calls.

09:17.390 --> 09:18.432
What?

09:20.059 --> 09:21.894
[tense music continues]

09:21.978 --> 09:24.230
Are you messing with me
for my birthday still?

09:24.313 --> 09:26.190
Is that what's going on? Huh?

09:27.567 --> 09:29.610
That's enough. It's not funny.

09:31.821 --> 09:33.030
I'm not doing that.

09:33.948 --> 09:35.324
Sorry about yesterday.

09:40.204 --> 09:41.455
[doorbell chiming]

09:41.539 --> 09:43.541
[tense music continues]

09:48.588 --> 09:50.881
[chiming]

09:57.221 --> 09:58.472
[sighs]

10:08.733 --> 10:11.068
FINAL EXAM
IN 1 DAY

10:11.152 --> 10:13.070
- [Jeong-chan] Whoa!
- [Tae-hun] What the hell?

10:13.154 --> 10:15.072
- [boy 1] Hey.
- [Jeong-chan] Let's go for a smoke.

10:15.156 --> 10:17.116
- [Tae-hun sighs] Damn it.
- [boy 1] What is that?

10:17.199 --> 10:19.327
- [boy 2] Tell you later.
- [boy 1] Yeah, right.

10:21.454 --> 10:22.747
[Tae-hun] Shit.

10:24.999 --> 10:26.208
[sighs]

10:28.919 --> 10:30.546
Why is Oh Beom-seok absent?

10:32.840 --> 10:33.883
No idea.

10:34.759 --> 10:36.010
Haven't you called him?

10:36.844 --> 10:38.054
You guys are pretty tight.

10:39.055 --> 10:41.182
His phone's turned off.
You know what's up?

10:42.141 --> 10:44.935
- Tell him he owes me for the damages.
- Yeah, I know.

10:49.315 --> 10:50.483
What?

10:51.734 --> 10:52.610
What damages?

10:54.612 --> 10:55.821
[sighs]

10:57.865 --> 10:59.909
It cost 800,000 won.

11:01.410 --> 11:03.788
If you don't pay me back,
I'll kill you, 'kay?

11:06.624 --> 11:07.667
Answer me.

11:09.126 --> 11:10.169
[Jeong-chan] Okay.

11:13.339 --> 11:14.340
[phone buzzing]

11:14.423 --> 11:18.552
JEONG-CHAN

11:22.932 --> 11:26.352
- Your call cannot be completed as dialed.
- Damn it! Pick up your phone, Beom-seok.

11:26.435 --> 11:29.563
- Please leave a message after the tone.
- Ahn Su-ho needs to be taught a lesson.

11:29.647 --> 11:32.274
[boy 1] Hey, but why
isn't Yeon Si-eun at school?

11:32.900 --> 11:34.318
[boy 2] Did he actually die?

11:34.985 --> 11:38.739
- Yeong-bin was way over the line.
- Hey, what's with all this bullshit?

11:39.240 --> 11:42.368
We'd all be attending his funeral
if he was dead, dude.

11:43.577 --> 11:45.746
- Damn it.
- [phone bleeps]

11:45.830 --> 11:47.581
- [ringing tone]
- Ah, man.

11:54.964 --> 11:55.965
[Jeong-chan sighs]

11:59.468 --> 12:00.720
[groans]

12:02.805 --> 12:03.764
[yelps]

12:05.224 --> 12:06.225
[coughs]

12:06.934 --> 12:08.018
[groans]

12:09.937 --> 12:11.230
Wait! Please wait.

12:12.732 --> 12:15.818
Oh Beom-seok called you,
but you wouldn't pick up,

12:15.901 --> 12:18.988
so he brought that girl over
to make you come meet us.

12:19.905 --> 12:20.781
What?

12:21.282 --> 12:24.535
[Jeong-chan] You know,
that girl who lives with you. But

12:25.619 --> 12:28.539
we expected you instead. Not Yeon Si-eun.

12:28.622 --> 12:30.624
[suspenseful music playing]

12:37.965 --> 12:39.467
- And?
- [Jeong-chan] A… and…

12:39.550 --> 12:40.676
Uh, Yeong-bin has this friend

12:40.760 --> 12:42.845
who was paid by Oh Beom-seok
to beat you up.

12:45.347 --> 12:47.767
Oh Beom-seok did everything.
None of this was us.

12:52.938 --> 12:53.773
[Jeong-chan yelps]

13:08.537 --> 13:09.830
[Yeong-i] What's going on?

13:12.124 --> 13:13.626
Where is Si-eun hospitalized?

13:21.717 --> 13:23.177
He went home today.

13:26.013 --> 13:27.348
I'm sorry. It's all 'cause of me.

13:28.974 --> 13:30.100
[Yeong-i sighs]

13:34.313 --> 13:35.189
Hey!

13:42.947 --> 13:45.574
Si-eun told me
I had to keep it a secret from you.

13:48.244 --> 13:49.620
Stay out of trouble.

13:58.546 --> 14:00.548
[doorbell chiming]

14:07.555 --> 14:08.639
[Si-eun] Who is it?

14:10.599 --> 14:11.517
[Su-ho] Delivery.

14:12.017 --> 14:13.477
[clock ticking]

14:16.105 --> 14:17.857
Hey, what's up?

14:18.941 --> 14:22.653
[Su-ho] What do you mean, what's up?
I'm thirsty. Give me water.

14:28.242 --> 14:29.827
[lock bleeps]

14:38.127 --> 14:39.169
[chuckles]

14:40.713 --> 14:41.714
You doing all right?

14:44.884 --> 14:46.510
Sure. Yeah.

14:47.428 --> 14:48.470
Why are you here?

14:48.554 --> 14:51.015
I was just in the neighborhood.

15:05.905 --> 15:06.739
Are you okay?

15:11.076 --> 15:12.036
Why?

15:19.835 --> 15:21.921
Tomorrow's finals. Coming to school?

15:25.049 --> 15:25.966
Yeah.

15:26.800 --> 15:27.801
I gotta study.

15:29.303 --> 15:30.721
Okay, good.

15:32.181 --> 15:33.307
See you in class.

15:35.851 --> 15:36.936
[chuckles]

15:43.776 --> 15:45.736
["9" by Han playing]

15:52.743 --> 15:57.748
♪ I'm wearin' out discreetly… ♪

15:58.707 --> 15:59.833
[lock bleeps]

16:04.880 --> 16:09.802
♪ It's somewhere I need to go ♪

16:17.351 --> 16:22.022
♪ Summer's gone and winter's comin' ♪

16:28.570 --> 16:30.072
[music fades]

16:32.491 --> 16:33.701
[door opens]

16:37.746 --> 16:39.665
- Is he in his room?
- Yes, sir.

16:42.292 --> 16:43.877
You little bastard!

16:44.628 --> 16:46.505
You're nothing but fucking vermin.

16:46.588 --> 16:51.135
[panting] I… told you not to do anything
that shits on my name.

16:51.802 --> 16:52.886
You didn't listen.

16:52.970 --> 16:55.264
- Huh? You little shit!
- [poignant music playing]

16:55.347 --> 16:57.141
What's your goddamn problem?

16:57.224 --> 17:01.186
I told you to do what I say,
barely breathe, and live a quiet life.

17:01.729 --> 17:03.689
You're so pathetic. That was too hard?

17:03.772 --> 17:06.400
Is that too hard? You shit, answer me.

17:07.067 --> 17:07.985
Fucking loser!

17:08.068 --> 17:10.404
You're such a fucking little bitch!

17:11.405 --> 17:13.574
Whew! This fucking little bastard.

17:14.783 --> 17:15.701
You…

17:16.618 --> 17:18.495
Once you go study abroad,

17:19.079 --> 17:20.998
you're free to do whatever
the hell you want.

17:21.081 --> 17:22.958
Die from drugs, I don't give a shit.

17:24.460 --> 17:28.589
Just never tell anyone
that you are my son. Understand?

17:29.590 --> 17:30.591
Hey!

17:31.467 --> 17:32.843
Keep an eye on this punk.

17:33.343 --> 17:34.762
[door slams]

17:37.639 --> 17:38.891
[shuddering]

17:39.641 --> 17:41.643
I never asked to be your son.

17:47.232 --> 17:48.233
[music fades]

17:49.943 --> 17:51.570
[insects chirping]

18:02.247 --> 18:03.624
Beom-seok-kun.

18:03.707 --> 18:05.292
Fuck off! Damn it.

18:06.335 --> 18:08.587
Hands off! Don't follow me.

18:13.300 --> 18:15.302
[breathing heavily]

18:16.345 --> 18:18.388
- [driver] Where are you headed?
- Just drive, please.

18:32.402 --> 18:33.946
[phone chimes]

18:39.118 --> 18:40.911
[phone buzzing]

18:41.578 --> 18:46.834
MISSED CALL: SU-HO, JEONG-CHAN,
YEONG-BIN, TAE-HUN

18:48.669 --> 18:51.839
SU-HO
IMAGE

18:51.922 --> 18:54.716
ANSWER THE PHONE,
OR I WILL KILL YOUR FRIENDS

18:59.972 --> 19:01.515
- [Yeong-bin wailing]
- [crunching]

19:01.598 --> 19:04.059
[moans] Hey, wait.

19:04.643 --> 19:05.519
[moans]

19:05.602 --> 19:06.770
So you better…

19:07.271 --> 19:08.147
[Yeong-bin gasps]

19:08.230 --> 19:09.314
…get Oh Beom-seok.

19:11.275 --> 19:13.443
I can't. I have no idea where he went.

19:13.527 --> 19:15.571
He's not answering any of my calls.

19:21.368 --> 19:23.871
- Ah, shit.
- [Su-ho] Punishment's the same, then.

19:28.959 --> 19:30.169
[Yeong-bin gasps]

19:30.252 --> 19:31.628
[phone buzzing]

19:31.712 --> 19:33.255
[siren blaring in distance]

19:39.720 --> 19:42.389
BEOM-SEOK

19:48.729 --> 19:50.022
Where are you at?

19:56.612 --> 19:58.197
Where are you, bitch-ass?

20:01.033 --> 20:01.992
Why?

20:03.327 --> 20:04.411
[Su-ho] Oh Beom-seok.

20:06.371 --> 20:07.664
You better stop hiding.

20:08.540 --> 20:10.542
[tense music playing]

20:16.173 --> 20:17.549
[phone clatters]

20:17.633 --> 20:18.717
[crunching]

20:18.800 --> 20:20.719
[screams]

20:20.802 --> 20:23.555
[groaning]

20:24.139 --> 20:25.891
Oh shit, man.

20:25.974 --> 20:28.060
[whimpering]

20:31.230 --> 20:32.397
[phone bleeps]

20:36.318 --> 20:40.572
OH BEOM-SEOK

20:45.953 --> 20:46.995
Hey, what's up?

20:51.917 --> 20:53.335
Ahn Su-ho's game on.

20:55.045 --> 20:56.046
I'll pay.

21:06.765 --> 21:07.975
[music fades]

21:17.526 --> 21:19.528
[phone buzzing]

21:26.493 --> 21:27.619
Hello?

21:28.495 --> 21:29.454
Hey.

21:30.831 --> 21:32.582
Have you been in touch with Su-ho?

21:35.168 --> 21:38.088
Yeah, he stopped by earlier today.

21:39.464 --> 21:41.550
Su-ho found out about that fight.

21:42.759 --> 21:43.802
[Si-eun] What?

21:45.053 --> 21:48.015
[Yeong-i] He's not at work,
and he's not picking up his phone.

21:50.309 --> 21:52.019
Did he say anything to you?

21:56.648 --> 21:57.691
Do you think

21:58.900 --> 22:00.819
he went looking for Oh Beom-seok?

22:03.113 --> 22:04.281
I'll try to call him.

22:07.617 --> 22:08.493
[taps phone]

22:08.577 --> 22:09.661
[phone bleeps]

22:09.745 --> 22:11.288
[tense music playing]

22:26.511 --> 22:27.929
[Su-ho] You filming a movie?

22:30.015 --> 22:32.934
What the hell is this? Seriously.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.731
Where's Oh Beom-seok?

23:24.903 --> 23:26.071
It's been a while.

23:28.698 --> 23:29.741
[Beom-seok sighs]

23:31.326 --> 23:33.578
[sighs] I'm the one that you're mad at.

23:34.871 --> 23:36.706
Why are you messing with the others?

23:38.500 --> 23:39.835
What did they do wrong?

23:40.961 --> 23:42.045
[Beom-seok sighs]

23:48.093 --> 23:49.219
I'm sorry…

23:54.683 --> 23:56.268
for hurting your feelings.

24:01.398 --> 24:02.399
[Beom-seok sighs]

24:02.899 --> 24:04.359
[Su-ho] I apologized to you.

24:07.028 --> 24:09.281
Your turn to apologize
to Si-eun and Yeong-i.

24:12.409 --> 24:13.493
No, thanks.

24:15.412 --> 24:17.247
I have nothing to apologize for.

24:20.041 --> 24:21.168
Please just do it.

24:26.339 --> 24:27.507
I said no.

24:33.889 --> 24:35.182
Then you'll get beaten

24:36.600 --> 24:38.185
till you come to your senses.

24:44.816 --> 24:46.193
[Woo-yeong] Hey, Ahn Su-ho.

24:49.654 --> 24:50.822
Ah.

24:51.406 --> 24:52.407
[chuckles]

24:53.742 --> 24:54.784
Climb in.

24:56.953 --> 24:58.663
Are you seriously paying
this asshole money

25:00.165 --> 25:01.500
just to beat me up?

25:01.583 --> 25:02.918
[sniffles]

25:03.710 --> 25:04.628
[sighs]

25:06.254 --> 25:08.173
You're really pathetic, you know that?

25:14.930 --> 25:17.432
Gimme a sec. I need to warm up. [grunts]

25:18.058 --> 25:19.100
[boy 1] Shit!

25:19.184 --> 25:20.644
[yells] Oh shit!

25:20.727 --> 25:21.645
[wails]

25:21.728 --> 25:22.938
[all grunting]

25:23.813 --> 25:24.981
- [grunts]
- [boy 2] Hey!

25:28.527 --> 25:30.153
[boy 3 wails]

25:31.488 --> 25:33.365
[boy 4 groans]

25:37.494 --> 25:38.620
[thud]

25:39.329 --> 25:41.289
I guess you're still workin' out.

25:41.373 --> 25:43.416
Huh. Some people might think
you're still an athlete.

25:43.500 --> 25:45.585
Do you not remember me kicking your ass?

25:48.296 --> 25:49.297
Get in.

25:51.967 --> 25:53.635
[sighs]

26:06.773 --> 26:09.401
Well, the moment is finally here,
my hyeong-nims.

26:09.484 --> 26:13.613
I told you I lost badly to this guy
back in middle school, right?

26:14.155 --> 26:16.408
This fight
is going to be my revenge match.

26:17.325 --> 26:18.451
Salute.

26:19.035 --> 26:21.246
- [Jeong-chan] It's starting.
- [Tae-hun] Bet he can fight.

26:21.329 --> 26:23.081
[Jeong-chan] For sure, whatever. Let's go.

26:23.164 --> 26:26.167
Let's make the video fun. Yeah?

26:26.251 --> 26:27.419
[Tae-hun] Please, Woo-yeong.

26:27.502 --> 26:30.463
- You have to win. You're our only hope.
- [Su-ho] Talking shit?

26:32.215 --> 26:33.633
[dramatic music playing]

26:33.717 --> 26:35.510
- [boy 3] Oh no…
- [Tae-hun] What was that?

26:41.933 --> 26:43.101
Ooh! Ooh.

26:43.602 --> 26:45.312
Fuck, man, that was so close.

26:47.647 --> 26:49.649
- [Jeong-chan] That's right!
- [Tae-hun] Whoo!

26:50.233 --> 26:51.443
Your left leg's fucked up, huh?

26:51.526 --> 26:53.528
- [Jeong-chan] Dude.
- What are you gonna do about it?

26:57.490 --> 26:59.659
- [boys] Whoa! Whoa!
- [Woo-yeong] Oh shit.

27:02.329 --> 27:04.789
- [Tae-hun] Behind you!
- [boy 1] Get up, Woo-yeong!

27:05.373 --> 27:06.958
- [all shouting]
- [Woo-yeong] Damn it!

27:07.042 --> 27:09.669
- [boy 1] Get up, get up!
- [Tae-hun] Come on! Woo-yeong!

27:09.753 --> 27:11.546
- [Jeong-chan] You got this!
- [Tae-hun] Shit!

27:12.881 --> 27:14.341
[Jeong-chan] Woo-yeong, hit him.

27:14.424 --> 27:17.427
- [boy 2] Woo-yeong! Get your revenge!
- [boy 3] Kick his ass! His leg. Yes!

27:17.510 --> 27:20.055
- Get it. Okay!
- [Tae-hun] Great job, Woo-yeong!

27:21.097 --> 27:23.433
- [boy 2] Get him, Woo-yeong!
- [boy 3] Come on! You got this!

27:23.516 --> 27:25.769
- [boy 2] Show your power! Shit!
- [boy 3] Come on, get him.

27:25.852 --> 27:27.687
- [Tae-hun] Oh, fuck this!
- [boy 4] Let's go!

27:27.771 --> 27:29.856
- [Su-ho] You got lucky.
- [Woo-yeong] Fuck you, asshole.

27:29.939 --> 27:32.359
[Jeong-chan] There we go.
There we go! Oh my God, yeah!

27:32.442 --> 27:33.735
- Killer punch!
- [Tae-hun] Yeah!

27:33.818 --> 27:35.153
[Tae-hun] Go! Let's go!

27:35.236 --> 27:38.031
- Kill him. Kill that fucking bastard.
- [boy 2] Let's go!

27:38.114 --> 27:39.449
[Woo-yeong grunts]

27:42.494 --> 27:43.453
That's not good.

27:50.752 --> 27:51.961
What the fuck, dude?

27:52.045 --> 27:53.338
[Woo-yeong] Hey! Eat shit!

27:54.130 --> 27:56.132
[whooshing and high-pitched ringing]

28:07.102 --> 28:08.311
[sounds fade]

28:08.395 --> 28:10.063
[Jeong-chan] He's so fucked.

28:11.064 --> 28:12.982
- Oh, look at that asshole.
- [boy 3] Yeah, dude.

28:13.066 --> 28:14.567
- [all gasping]
- [Tae-hun] Fuck, man.

28:14.651 --> 28:15.819
[Jeong-chan laughs] Okay.

28:15.902 --> 28:18.655
- Man, that was a fucking fight.
- [Tae-hun] They're fucking crazy.

28:26.496 --> 28:28.081
[breathing shakily]

28:30.750 --> 28:31.751
Hey.

28:33.294 --> 28:35.839
Who's the pathetic one now, shithead? Huh?

28:39.467 --> 28:40.468
Huh?

28:41.636 --> 28:43.263
Tell me what to do now, man.

28:48.059 --> 28:49.686
Who the fuck do you think you are?

28:50.186 --> 28:52.105
You're always looking down on me like…

28:52.731 --> 28:54.315
like I'm a piece of shit.

28:55.900 --> 28:56.901
Hey.

28:59.654 --> 29:01.322
Will you please just wake up…

29:06.119 --> 29:09.664
[sighs] …and stop blaming other people,
Beom-seok-a.

29:10.915 --> 29:12.083
[sighs]

29:12.625 --> 29:13.585
Hey.

29:14.502 --> 29:17.756
Stop saying my fucking name,
you cocky shit.

29:19.507 --> 29:22.051
Bitch. You son of a bitch.

29:22.135 --> 29:24.095
[grunting] Damn it.

29:24.179 --> 29:25.597
Hey, fuck this. Let's jump in.

29:28.516 --> 29:30.602
- Son of a bitch! Cocky shit.
- [Tae-hun] Bastard!

29:30.685 --> 29:32.270
- Fucking asshole.
- [boy 3] Asshole.

29:32.937 --> 29:35.231
[Beom-seok] You're pathetic.
You son of a bitch.

29:35.315 --> 29:37.150
- Stupid shithead.
- [gasping and grunting]

29:37.233 --> 29:38.610
[Beom-seok] Fuck you.

29:38.693 --> 29:41.112
- [boy 5 laughing]
- [boy 4] That's right, keep doing this!

29:41.196 --> 29:43.782
- Shithead! Fucking bitch!
- [Beom-seok] Don't tell me what to do.

29:43.865 --> 29:46.034
- [Jeong-chan] Eat it!
- [Tae-hun] Fucking asshole!

29:46.117 --> 29:49.287
[Beom-seok] You son of a bitch.
Son of a bitch! Fuck you.

29:52.582 --> 29:54.250
[panting]

30:02.383 --> 30:04.844
You motherfucker. You shithead.

30:04.928 --> 30:08.139
- [panting]
- [Jin-won's secretary] Beom-seok-kun.

30:10.433 --> 30:11.810
[Aide Park shouts] Oh Beom-seok!

30:17.232 --> 30:19.734
- [Beom-seok] Oh fuck.
- [Aide Park] Let's go.

30:20.485 --> 30:21.986
[Beom-seok groans]

30:23.196 --> 30:24.489
Don't touch me.

30:25.949 --> 30:28.409
- Let's go.
- Stop. Stop!

30:28.493 --> 30:30.787
Let fucking go of me, you fuck!

30:31.704 --> 30:32.789
[secretary gasps]

30:33.331 --> 30:34.499
[panting]

30:37.252 --> 30:38.586
[sighs]

30:39.379 --> 30:41.339
- [footsteps]
- [Jeong-chan] Ahn Su-ho.

30:48.972 --> 30:50.056
Ahn Su-ho.

30:57.021 --> 30:59.524
- Hey, this bastard's not breathing.
- [Tae-hun] What?

31:06.281 --> 31:07.282
Ahn Su-ho.

31:11.327 --> 31:12.203
[boy 1] Fuck.

31:12.287 --> 31:14.247
- Oh fuck.
- [Tae-hun] Fuck.

31:19.252 --> 31:21.379
If you two leave, it'll get complicated.

31:22.964 --> 31:24.674
You were the last to touch Su-ho.

31:25.842 --> 31:27.760
I'll handle this. So just keep quiet.

31:29.888 --> 31:31.180
Uh, what should we do?

31:33.308 --> 31:35.310
["Again" by Han playing]

31:42.567 --> 31:47.572
♪ I miss the memories, I miss your tune ♪

31:51.409 --> 31:56.080
♪ It was only just yesterday
A chance to talk to you… ♪

31:57.790 --> 31:59.500
[breathing unsteadily]

32:00.585 --> 32:05.131
♪ It's summer already
Still, I don't know what to do… ♪

32:06.466 --> 32:08.259
Su-ho. Su-ho. Su-ho-ya.

32:09.427 --> 32:13.306
♪ How deep are you? No tracks to follow… ♪

32:13.389 --> 32:15.099
[Beom-seok sobbing] Su-ho. Su-ho-ya.

32:17.852 --> 32:21.064
- Su-ho! Su-ho-ya.
- ♪ How real am I ♪

32:21.147 --> 32:24.233
♪ To face you hollow? ♪

32:24.317 --> 32:26.527
Su-ho-ya, please look at me.

32:27.445 --> 32:30.740
- ♪ Am I nothin' to you? ♪
- Let's go, Beom-seok-kun.

32:32.533 --> 32:34.827
- We have to go, right now.
- Su-ho-ya! Hey!

32:34.911 --> 32:36.329
- [sobbing]
- Beom-seok-kun.

32:36.871 --> 32:39.332
- Hey, drag him out of here.
- [Beom-seok] What about Su-ho?

32:39.415 --> 32:41.584
No, wait. He won't open his eyes.

32:42.418 --> 32:44.045
What's going to happen to him?

32:45.463 --> 32:50.802
- ♪ I feel my faith, my heart is racin'… ♪
- [Beom-seok sobbing]

32:50.885 --> 32:52.553
Wait. Wait a minute.

32:53.972 --> 32:59.560
- Wait, wait.
- ♪ I wanna dive into your warmth… ♪

33:00.937 --> 33:02.063
[Yeong-i] Si-eun-a.

33:02.939 --> 33:04.023
Where's Su-ho?

33:04.983 --> 33:06.401
He's not here.

33:07.610 --> 33:09.988
[sighs] He's not answering his phone.

33:10.905 --> 33:11.781
Where did he go?

33:11.864 --> 33:14.033
♪ Do you feel nothin'? ♪

33:16.035 --> 33:19.163
- ♪ You must feel nothin'… ♪
- [ringing tone]

33:21.791 --> 33:26.045
♪ My dear, it's time
For the hundredth time… ♪

33:28.131 --> 33:29.298
[Yeong-i gasps]

33:30.675 --> 33:34.887
♪ I finally do make up my mind… ♪

33:34.971 --> 33:36.973
[ringing tone continues]

33:39.475 --> 33:43.312
♪ It's time I lose you for good… ♪

33:43.396 --> 33:45.398
[door slam echoing]

33:46.607 --> 33:49.027
♪ I'm lost again ♪

34:00.997 --> 34:03.791
[gentle, poignant
instrumental version of "Hero" playing]

36:17.133 --> 36:18.759
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS
ARE FICTIONAL

36:18.843 --> 36:20.428
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
